  "updated_at": "2026-01-12T07:39:15.413765+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.4039/entm9745fv",
  "reference": "Holling CS. The Functional Response of Predators to Prey Density. Memoirs of the Entomological Society of Canada. 1965;97(S45):5-60."
}